Ray, either on the list or to me privately:

1. The line-eater that was snatching the first line or two, circa late
December. Confirmed by others. Now fixed.

2. Missing posts, posts that I sent out that never appeared on the
list (or are visible with the ::list command). This happened to at
least 3 posts I sent, circa Tues-Wed of this past week. 

Ray suggested I checked with Netcom, my service. I mailed
