I share Harvey's sense of priorities, though. Robust software beats
whizzy features every time.

I use few of the list commands, and don't want to have manuals
explaining how to send multiple commands, wildcarded ranges, etc. So I
use at most a few of the basic commands (::list, ::exclude user,
